&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At least 5 years of relevant experience in managing government relations, partnership development, or public affairs—preferably in an NGO or international development context. Detailed understanding and demonstrated experience working with national level government officials in Rwanda&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated experience in project management, including planning, coordination, and execution of complex, multi-stakeholder initiatives reliably.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven ability to identify, develop, and manage strategic partnership pipelines, including demonstrated experience in resource mobilization. Experience with key donors such as US Government, FCDO, and large private foundations is preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong understanding of government operations and the ability to navigate complex bureaucratic environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to identify and analyze trends, risks, and opportunities in the policy and regulatory environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent oral and written communication skills, including preparation of presentations and formal correspondence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Able to coordinate and update cross-cultural teams distributed across many time zones&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated success in a high-performance work environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fluency in English (written and spoken) is required; working knowledge of French is an asset. Exceptional communication (written and verbal)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working with and representing organisations to national media.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aptitude to learn various software tools that GiveDirectly uses, including Slack, Google Spreadsheets, Google Calendar, and Asana&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
